Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:48.79,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur2}不慌不忙行動起來  彷　自數萬年前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:48.79,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur2\fnFOT-PalRamune Std B\fs58\pos(736,3)}彿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:57.89,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur2}此刻便已如注定  看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.85,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur2}風兒歌唱  雨滴訴説
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:08.19,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur2}我們終將抵達  那光之居所
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:12.44,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur2}層層　　  交織重重
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:12.44,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur2\fnFOT-PalRamune Std B\fs54\pos(585,5)}疊疊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:16.63,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur2}是地球上巧妙的偶然
